        "TileImage": "$($repository 08c3b5e8-8aff-4306-a9f9-eaeb076b22a9).Image",
        "Description": "This is an interesting contract 47. The Client Gianmario Lorenzini has put a hit out on the two men responsible for his beloved&apos;s demise, as well as himself. For the bodygaurd who arranged his wife&apos;s death to be ruled as an accident, Lorenzini has a sense of humor, he must die to an &quot;Accident&quot;. For the security gaurd who could not even recognize the woman he had killed, he must die with &quot;no suspicions&quot; as to his assailant. As for Lorenzini himself, he wishes to see you coming 47, no disguisies.",
